      "message": "this is a full logical superset of the above condition and each section does the exact same thing, so we really haven\u0027t change any logic in patch set 8 from the base. I am confused on what you are actually trying to accomplish now.\n\nThe previous condition of\nif ((cc1 \u003d\u003d TYPEC_CC_VOLT_RD ||\n     cc2 \u003d\u003d TYPEC_CC_VOLT_RD) ||\n    (cc1 \u003d\u003d TYPEC_CC_VOLT_RA \u0026\u0026\n     cc2 \u003d\u003d TYPEC_CC_VOLT_RA))\n\nwould also catch the case of TrySource enabled and only one of the CC pins is Rd. It would have forced the statemachine to go to SRC_DISCONNECTED_DEBOUNCE in that scenario previously too.",
